1. Yes. On August 21, order in council P.C. 1963-1254 transferred to the Department of Defence Production, under the Public Service Rearrangement and Transfer of Duties Act, branches of the Department of Public Printing and Stationery. A comprehensive review of the tendering procedure is being mads by D.D.P. to ensure that it complies with the present tendering system of that department.
2.	(a) six; (b) five; (c) yes, a grade 6 purchasing agent with one year.
(3) (a) one; (b) none; (c) to the position chief purchasing agent (purchasing agent grade 6) at $8,960, effective April 1, 1961;
(d)	secretary, public printing and stationery;
(e)	competition No. 60-P-ID-133.
